# Security

- Treat every request as untrusted. Validate it on the server. A hidden button is not an access check.
- Never put `S3_ADMIN_ACCESS_KEY` or `S3_ADMIN_SECRET_KEY` in the API, worker, edge, or frontend environment. The API must exit if those variables are present.
- The `media` bucket stays private. Do not add a public-read policy or anonymous download.
- Do not log secrets, refresh cookies, or presigned URLs.
- Follow `docs/SECURITY_DESIGN.md` when adding auth, uploads, or playback. Do not weaken a control to make a test pass.
